              ┌─ Born under the stars ───────────────────────────────────────────────┐
              │                                                                      │
              │  You were born on 29 Greenleaf 1410, in the year of the Water        │
              │  Basilisk. You are 34 years old.                                     │
              │                                                                      │
              │  Rode coiled around the Roc's talon and slid off in front of it at   │
              │  the gate: patient and unblinking, and trusted by no one. Rivers     │
              │  and the deep sea, that always find a way: clever.                   │
              │                                                                      │
              │  Unblinking          You notice hidden things in passing, as if      │
              │                      trained to spot them.                           │
              │  Transfixing stare   The basilisk's stare: a foe nearby that sees    │
              │                      you slows to a crawl a moment; your eyes then   │
              │                      rest two hours.                                 │
              │  but Trusted by none No one makes way for you: you walk around.      │
              │  Always a way        Secret doors and hidden traps are easier for    │
              │                      you to find, and your searching reaches         │
              │                      farther.                                        │
              │                                                                      │
              │  Basilisk: Wi +2  Pr −1   Water: In +1                               │
